/* Dev Shree Saini — translations (English → German, French)

   HOW IT WORKS
   Every translatable element in index.html carries a `data-i18n` attribute.
   Its English text is the lookup key below; the value is [German, French].
   Text generated by js/main.js (project pop-ups) and js/globe.js (globe list)
   is looked up the same way through window.i18n.t().

   EDITING
   - Change English text in index.html → change the matching key here too,
     otherwise that one element simply stays in English.
   - Keys are compared with whitespace collapsed, so line breaks don't matter.
   - Values may contain inline HTML (<strong>, <em>, <a …>) where the English does.
   - Strings that are the same in every language go in I18N_SAME.

   Works when index.html is opened straight from disk — no server needed. */

